@startuml
autonumber
actor Client
participant "Filter (JwtAuthFilter)" as Filter
participant "Controller" as Ctrl
participant "Service" as Svc
participant "Repository" as Repo
database "Database" as DB

Client -> Filter: GET /api/v1/resource (Headers: Authorization: Bearer <AT>)
Filter -> Svc: jwtGenerator.isValidToken(AT)
Svc -> Svc: Validate signature & expiry of JWT
Svc -> Repo: tokenRepos.findByTokenStr(AT)
Repo -> DB: SELECT * FROM tokens WHERE token_str = AT
DB --> Repo: Token record (used=false, revoked=false)
Repo --> Svc: Token entity
Svc --> Filter: return true (Token valid)
Filter -> Repo: userRepos.findByUsername(username)
Repo -> DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = ...
DB --> Repo: User details
Repo --> Filter: User entity
Filter -> Filter: Set SecurityContextHolder (Authentication)
Filter -> Ctrl: Forward Request
Ctrl -> Svc: Get resource business logic
Svc --> Ctrl: Resource data
Ctrl --> Client: 200 OK (Resource data)
@enduml
